{"title":"Surya Kriya: Fire Up the Sun Within (Isha Hatha Yoga)","startsAt":"2026-11-28T08:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-29T12:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"For registration and more information, click **[here](https://innerengineering.sadhguru.org/toronto)**\n\nSurya Kriya is a potent yoga of tremendous antiquity, designed as a holistic process for health, wellness, and complete inner well-being. “Surya” means “sun,” and “kriya” means “inner energy process.” Surya Kriya activates the solar plexus to raise the samat prana, or solar heat, in the system. It also balances a person’s left and right energy channels, leading to stability of the body and stillness of the mind. This strong foundation becomes the basis to explore higher dimensions of life.\n\nTraditionally available only to select groups of yogis, Surya Kriya is offered by Sadhguru as a comprehensive spiritual practice that is ideal for the hectic pace of today’s world.\n\nThis is a hatha yoga program (physical postures) which will be taught step-by-step and guided by a teacher trained in India by Sadhguru. Once you have completed the program, you can practice on your own at home. Surya Kriya does not require previous experience with yoga.\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Develops mental clarity and focus\n* Remedies weak constitutions\n* Boosts vigor and vitality\n* Balances hormonal levels in the body\n* Prepares one for deeper states of meditation\n\nAnyone above 14 years of age can attend. No previous experience of yoga required.\n\nCost\nCAD 225\nEarly Bird CAD 200 (Expires on October 29th 2026)\n\nTiming\nSaturday, November 28th, 8:30 AM - 12:00 PM\nSunday, November 29th, 8:00 AM - 12:00 PM","venue":{"name":"Best Western Plus Toronto Airport Hotel","address":"5825 Dixie Rd, Mississauga","lat":43.652298,"lng":-79.641754,"city":"Mississauga"},"fee":{"amount":225,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"Inner Engineering Toronto (Isha Yoga & Meditation Classes)","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/3/5/0/highres_517029040.jpeg"}